---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service | SarkariPhotoResizer.com" description="Terms of service and usage conditions for SarkariPhotoResizer.com.">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 space-y-8">
    <div class="text-center space-y-2">
      <span class="text-xs font-black text-blue-600 uppercase tracking-wider">User Agreement</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500">Effective Date: November 1, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-sm border border-slate-200/80 prose prose-slate max-w-none text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-6">
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600">
          By accessing and using <strong>SarkariPhotoResizer.com</strong> ("the Website"), you agree to comply with and be bound by the following terms and conditions of use. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use our services.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3 border-t border-slate-100 pt-6">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">2. Description of Service</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600">
          SarkariPhotoResizer.com provides a free, client-side web application designed to help users crop, resize, and compress photographs and digital signatures to comply with technical requirements for educational and competitive examination application forms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3 border-t border-slate-100 pt-6">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">3. Permitted &amp; Fair Use</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600">
          You are permitted to use this tool for lawful, personal, and professional application preparation purposes (including cyber cafe operators helping candidates submit forms). You agree not to:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-slate-600">
          <li>Attempt to reverse-engineer, exploit, or inject malicious code into the platform.</li>
          <li>Use automated scrapers, bots, or excessive denial-of-service requests.</li>
          <li>Upload or process illegal, offensive, or counterfeit identity documents.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3 border-t border-slate-100 pt-6">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">4. Disclaimer of Official Affiliation &amp; Warranty</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600">
          The specifications and presets provided on this website are compiled from publicly available recruitment notifications for general reference. Examination authorities (SSC, UPSC, RRB, IBPS, etc.) may update their photo submission rules periodically. Users are solely responsible for cross-verifying their final files against the official notification published by the respective exam authority before submitting their application. The service is provided "as is" without warranty of any kind.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3 border-t border-slate-100 pt-6">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">5. Changes to Terms</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600">
          We reserve the right to revise these Terms of Service at any time. Continued use of the website following any changes signifies your acceptance of the updated terms.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
